  朝 | zhāo | morning; dawn; dynasty; court | mañana; alba; dinastía; corte | 月 | moon / flesh | 𠦝 (sun rising in mist/grass) | 月 (yuè, fading morning moon) | 12 | 左右结构 | Ancient oracle bone pictogram of the bright morning sun 杲 rising amid tall grass while the pale moon 月 fades away. | The radiant dawn sun rises through morning dew while the pale crescent moon (月) departs into dawn (朝). | El sol del alba despide sus primeros rayos entre el rocío mientras la luna menguante (月) se retira al amanecer (朝). | 55 | JBB | 
  三 | sān | three; several; triple | tres; varios; triple | 一 | one | 一 (heaven) | 一 (earth, man) | 3 | 单一结构 | Ancient ideogram of three stacked horizontal counting tallies, symbolizing the triad of Heaven, Earth, and Humanity. | Three level tallies laid parallel in ancient arithmetic count out the number three (三). | Tres varillas horizontales apiladas en el cómputo aritmético arcaico marcan el número tres (三). | 55 | MMM | 
